---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: null
description: LYNK is a community-based high school FIRST Robotics Competition team (FRC 9496) open to students in Rutherford County, North Carolina and the surrounding region.
eleventyNavigation:
  key: Home
---

<section class="hero hero--brand hero--tall">
  <img
    class="hero__media"
    src="/assets/img/hero/lynk-animated.webp"
    alt="LYNK 9496 logo"
    width="1280"
    height="720"
    fetchpriority="high"
  />
  <a class="hero__scroll-cue" href="#about" aria-label="Scroll to content">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 16.5 4.5 9l1.4-1.4L12 13.7l6.1-6.1L19.5 9z" /></svg>
  </a>
</section>

<section class="section section--dark section--center" id="about">
  <div class="section__inner">
    <h1>About Us</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      LYNK is a third year high school FIRST Robotic Competition (FRC) team,
      operating under the umbrella of the Inspire Carolina non-profit
      organization. We believe that FRC is a powerful program that can challenge
      and grow the high school students in our region, and have a positive impact
      on our community. We are a community-based team open to all high school
      students in Rutherford county North Carolina and the surrounding region.
      See below for more information and to register if you are interested in
      <a href="/registration/">joining us</a>!
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="section__inner">
    <div class="split">
      <div class="media-frame">
        <img
          src="/assets/img/home/team-champions.jpg"
          alt="The LYNK 9496 team celebrating with a FIRST Robotics Competition winner banner"
          width="1200"
          height="800"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="stack">
        <p>
          Our logo features a unique spelling of “link” as “LYNK,” which is
          intentional. We spelled it with a Y to remind us <em>why</em> we do
          what we do:
        </p>
        <img
          src="/assets/img/home/why-quote.png"
          alt="To inspire personal growth for students, so they can unleash their potential and create a ripple effect of positive change in the world."
          width="1200"
          height="425"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="btn-row btn-row--stretch" style="margin-top: 2.5rem">
      <a class="btn" href="{{ site.links.libraryOfKnowledge }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">
        LYNK Library of Knowledge
      </a>
      <a class="btn" href="{{ site.links.donate }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">
        Click Here to Invest in the Team
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--dark section--tight section--center">
  <div class="section__inner" style="display: grid; justify-items: center; gap: 1rem">
    <p style="margin: 0">Follow the team</p>
    {% include "partials/social.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--center">
  <div class="section__inner">
    <h1>Upcoming Events</h1>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--orange" style="padding-top: 0">
  <div class="section__inner">
    <div class="meeting-block">
      <p class="meeting-block__when">{{ events.meetings.when }}</p>
      <p>{{ events.meetings.what }}</p>
      <p>{{ events.meetings.where }}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="events">
      {%- for ev in events.competitions %}
        {%- if ev.conditional and not loop.first and not events.competitions[loop.index0 - 1].conditional %}
          <p class="events__note">{{ events.qualifierNote }}</p>
        {%- endif %}
        <div class="event">
          <span class="event__date">{{ ev.start | dateRange(ev.end) }}</span>
          <span class="event__kind">{{ ev.kind }}</span>
          <span class="event__venue">
            <a href="{{ ev.url }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">{{ ev.venue }}</a>
          </span>
        </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top: 2rem">
      <a class="btn btn--dark" href="/faqs/">FAQs</a>
      <a class="btn btn--dark" href="/registration/">Register Your Interest To Join The Team</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="section__inner">
    <div class="split split--top">
      <div class="stack">
        <h1>2026 Robot Name</h1>
        <p>For the 2026 FIRST Robotics Competition season, we are naming our robot…</p>
        <div class="media-frame">
          <img
            src="/assets/img/home/robot-2026-build.jpg"
            alt="A mentor assembling the 2026 robot chassis in the LYNK workshop"
            width="1400"
            height="1373"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stack">
        <img
          src="/assets/img/home/rebuilt-logo.png"
          alt="REBUILT presented by Haas — the 2026 FIRST Robotics Competition game"
          width="900"
          height="355"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <a class="btn btn--block" href="https://youtu.be/_fybREErgyM?si=ESVKe-B-unoUjGu9" rel="noopener" target="_blank">
          2026 FRC | REBUILT
        </a>
        <p>
          In REBUILT presented by Haas, two competing alliances are invited to
          score fuel, cross obstacles, and climb the tower before time runs out.
          Alliances earn additional rewards for meeting specific scoring
          thresholds.
        </p>

        <img
          src="/assets/img/home/build-log-banner.jpg"
          alt="LYNK 9496 Build Log"
          width="900"
          height="338"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <p>
          This thread is intended to serve as our Build Log. Rather than a
          structured, real-time build thread, this log will capture updates as
          time allows and as milestones are reached.
        </p>
        <p>
          Entries may vary in depth and frequency, but the goal is to document key
          decisions, progress, and lessons learned throughout the season when we
          have meaningful updates to share.
        </p>
        <a class="btn btn--block" href="{{ site.links.buildLog }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">
          Click Here to Read Our Build Log
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/sponsors.njk" %}
